B.Ta=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #015: Integrating Gemini AI natively in Flutter","Janak Swami \u2022 15 min watch \u2022 Published Today","In this episode, we connect our portfolio directly to Google's Gemini API. We cover setting up the HTTP requests, handling JSON parsing, and creating a sleek cyberpunk chat interface that slides in from the bottom right corner.\n\n*Video simulation active...*"],t.l)
B.T5=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #014: Creating a Matrix Rain effect with CustomPainter","Janak Swami \u2022 12 min watch \u2022 2 days ago","Today we dive deep into the `Canvas` API in Flutter. I'll show you how to draw thousands of falling characters at 60 FPS without dropping a single frame. The secret? Carefully managing state and not rebuilding the widget tree.\n\n*Video simulation active...*"],t.l)
B.T8=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #013: WebAssembly vs JavaScript: Performance testing","Janak Swami \u2022 20 min watch \u2022 1 week ago","WASM fundamentally changes the performance profile of Flutter Web. Instead of compiling Dart to JavaScript, we can now compile directly to WebAssembly, unlocking near-native performance for heavy computations like WebGL shaders and real-time audio processing."],t.l)
B.T3=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #012: Hacking the DOM: Chrome DevTools tricks","Janak Swami \u2022 8 min watch \u2022 2 weeks ago","A quick look at my favorite Chrome DevTools tricks. Ever needed to mock network requests or simulate a 3G connection? I'll show you my daily workflow for debugging complex web apps."],t.l)
B.T4=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #011: Building a Custom Physics Engine","Janak Swami \u2022 25 min watch \u2022 3 weeks ago","When building highly interactive portfolios, standard linear animations often fall short. By leveraging `forge2d` and the Canvas API, we can build custom rigid-body physics simulations directly in the browser.\n\nUsing a `ContactListener` allows us to create dynamic bouncing effects when UI components collide."],t.l)
B.T6=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #010: Why Flutter over React Native?","Janak Swami \u2022 18 min watch \u2022 1 month ago","A controversial topic! Today I break down exactly why I chose Flutter for my highly interactive, animation-heavy portfolio. The RenderObject layer simply provides too much control to ignore."],t.l)
B.SY=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #009: Micro-animations with flutter_animate","Janak Swami \u2022 10 min watch \u2022 1 month ago","Adding `.animate().slideY().fadeIn()` can completely change the feel of your app. In this vlog, we look at how to chain animations to create a cinematic boot sequence."],t.l)
B.T7=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #008: My 24-Hour Hackathon Experience","Janak Swami \u2022 30 min watch \u2022 2 months ago","Join me as I stay up for 24 hours straight building a decentralized voting app. Lots of coffee, plenty of bugs, and an eventual deployment to Vercel at 4:00 AM."],t.l)
B.SZ=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #007: Automating my smart home with Dart","Janak Swami \u2022 14 min watch \u2022 2 months ago","Dart isn't just for UI! I wrote a custom Dart backend server that talks to my Phillips Hue lights and smart blinds. Now my room turns into a cyberpunk red/blue neon cave when I compile code."],t.l)
B.T0=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #006: The beauty of Glassmorphism UI","Janak Swami \u2022 9 min watch \u2022 3 months ago","Using `BackdropFilter` and `ImageFilter.blur()`, we can create stunning frosted glass effects. I'll show you how to optimize these so they don't destroy your web app's framerate."],t.l)
B.T_=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #005: Deep dive into Flutter's Render Tree","Janak Swami \u2022 22 min watch \u2022 3 months ago","What actually happens when you call `setState`? Today we look at the Element tree, the Render tree, and how Flutter's layout algorithm works under the hood (Constraint goes down, Size goes up)."],t.l)
B.SX=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #004: Setting up a minimal developer workspace","Janak Swami \u2022 11 min watch \u2022 4 months ago","A tour of my physical desk setup and my digital workspace. VS Code extensions, terminal aliases, and why I use a 40% mechanical keyboard."],t.l)
B.T2=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #003: Reverse engineering an arcade game","Janak Swami \u2022 19 min watch \u2022 4 months ago","I found an old compiled binary of a classic arcade game. Let's use some basic reverse engineering tools to figure out how its memory management works!"],t.l)
B.T9=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #002: Learning WebGL shaders for UI effects","Janak Swami \u2022 16 min watch \u2022 5 months ago","Writing raw GLSL can be intimidating. I break down a simple Fragment Shader that creates a swirling liquid effect, and show how to use it in Flutter via `FragmentProgram`."],t.l)
B.T1=new A.bn(B.bt,["\u25b6\ufe0f VLOG #001: Hello World - The Beginning","Janak Swami \u2022 5 min watch \u2022 6 months ago","Welcome to the channel! In this inaugural vlog, I talk about my goals for the year, my passion for front-end architecture, and what you can expect from this dev log series."],t.l)
