B.UY=new A.bs("State Lifecycle Chronology","FLUTTER CORE","LIFECYCLE SYSTEM","The State object encapsulates mutable logic. Its strict lifecycle triggers in chronological sequence:\n1. createState() - Instantiates state object.\n2. initState() - Once-off initialization hook.\n3. didChangeDependencies() - Triggers immediately after initState and whenever inherited dependencies mutate.\n4. build() - Draws layout configs.\n5. didUpdateWidget() - Invoked when parent widget parameters shift.\n6. dispose() - Clean up controller leaks.","@override\nvoid didUpdateWidget(covariant MyWidget oldWidget) {\n  super.didUpdateWidget(oldWidget);\n  if (widget.userId != oldWidget.userId) {\n    _reloadUserData();\n  }\n}",B.P9)
