B.UD=new A.bs("Isolate Thread Concurrency","DART ADVANCED","MULTI-THREADING","Dart code runs within an isolated memory sandbox called an Isolate. Because isolates share no memory directly, multi-threading requires compiling ReceivePort and SendPort messaging channels to serialize and stream heavy payloads without locking UI threads.",'Future<void> spawnCompute() async {\n  final receiver = ReceivePort();\n  await Isolate.spawn(_heavyWorker, receiver.sendPort);\n  receiver.listen((msg) => print("Output: $msg"));\n}\nstatic void _heavyWorker(SendPort sp) {\n  sp.send("Heavy Calculations resolved.");\n}',B.Q9)
