B.UO=new A.bs("InheritedWidget Map Lookups","STATE PROPAGATION","DIRECT DISPATCH","All modern reactive state packages compile over `InheritedWidget`. The Flutter BuildContext maintains an internal O(1) direct-lookup map registering available InheritedWidgets, allowing child elements to search state instantly without recursively climbing parents.","class MyProvider extends InheritedWidget {\n  const MyProvider({required this.data, required super.child});\n  final double data;\n  static MyProvider? of(BuildContext context) =>\n      context.dependOnInheritedWidgetOfExactType<MyProvider>();\n  @override\n  bool updateShouldNotify(covariant MyProvider old) => data != old.data;\n}",B.Rf)
B.Pr=A.a(s(["inheritedmodel","aspect","rebuild","performance","state"]),t.s)
B.Uo=new A.bs("InheritedModel Aspect Rebuilds","STATE PROPAGATION","PARTIAL REBUILDS","While standard InheritedWidget triggers element rebuilds whenever any state mutations occur, `InheritedModel` allows binding rebuild constraints to specific aspects of the data model. Child widgets will only repaint if their observed aspect changes.",'class UserStore extends InheritedModel<String> {\n  const UserStore({required this.user, required super.child});\n  final UserProfile user;\n  @override\n  bool updateShouldNotifyDependent(UserStore old, Set<String> deps) {\n    return deps.contains("name") && user.name != old.user.name;\n  }\n  @override\n  bool updateShouldNotify(UserStore old) => user != old.user;\n}',B.Pr)
