B.UU=new A.bs("Offline Sync & Cache Strategies","STATE PROPAGATION","LOCAL STATE","Production applications require robust offline operations. Developers write SQLite or Hive local buffers to cache readouts. UI reads from local database logs, and background sync worker pools push mutations back to cloud servers when online.","Future<void> saveLocalCache(UserProfile profile) async {\n  final box = await Hive.openBox('profile_box');\n  await box.put('cached_user', profile.toJson());\n}",B.Pw)
