B.Uw=new A.bs("Dart FFI Synchronous Native Bindings","BUILD & NATIVE FFI","NATIVE SPEED","Dart Foreign Function Interface (FFI) enables zero-latency synchronous native C/C++/Rust library execution directly within the Dart runtime thread, bypassing slow serializing asynchronous Platform Channels completely.","import 'dart:ffi' as ffi;\ntypedef NativeAdd = ffi.Int32 Function(ffi.Int32, ffi.Int32);\ntypedef DartAdd = int Function(int, int);\nfinal dylib = ffi.DynamicLibrary.open('libcalc.so');\nfinal add = dylib.lookupFunction<NativeAdd, DartAdd>('add');",B.PS)
